  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Me&My Uncle** (1 other source): Me & My Uncle runs directly into Mexicali Blues, according to the uploader's notes [1]\n- **Uncle John’s Band** (1 other source): Uncle John's Band leads into a jam before Drums, per the uploader's notes [1]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1994-03-17.139336.akgc391.cohen-lee.flac1644** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 140 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The reviewer says the venue is Nassau Coliseum [2]\n- The reviewer thinks the first set on this recording seems to come from a different show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1994-03-17.139336.akgc391.cohen-lee.flac1644**: taped by Dave Cohen and Justin Lee; transferred by Dave Cohen; source: flac16 44.1khz Source: AKG C391 ORTF in first row OTS 8 foot stand > Teac DAP20 @ 16/48. [1]. Also: The file identifier for this recording names AKG C391 microphones and Cohen-Lee [1]",
